   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conditional",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with **aș, ai, ar, am, ați, ar** plus the short infinitive without **a**: **aș merge** («I would go»). The main verb does not change for the person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Hypothesis",
     "texto": [
      "In English, after «if» we use the past tense («if I had time»). In Romanian, the standard present hypothesis uses the conditional in both parts."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
